1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,700
Difficult conversations matter because real life rarely gives us a clean second attempt.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:11,550
Second Take creates a private rehearsal space to try one before the moment matters.

3
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:17,400
Here I am rehearsing with Alex, a teammate on an unfinished project.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,420
I write naturally, and Alex responds inside one consistent scenario.

5
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:28,700
For one critical distinction, Second Take does not pretend to read my mind.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:33,740
I confirm whether I am asking what Alex can do, or asking Alex to do it.

7
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:40,700
At the Turning Point, the app saves an exact checkpoint: the same facts, personality, history, and state.

8
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:44,200
My first response creates one consequence.

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,260
Then I rewind to that identical moment.

10
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:51,200
Everything before the checkpoint is restored.

11
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,200
Only my response changes.

12
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:59,580
A more specific, collaborative message creates a genuinely different path.

13
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:03,000
Users experience both paths for free.

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,500
RevenueCat unlocks Full A/B Comparison through a real Test Store purchase.

15
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:14,100
CustomerInfo updates, and the Pro entitlement becomes active.

16
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:20,400
Now I can compare what I said, Alex's response, and the trajectory each choice created.

17
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:25,870
The value is visible instead of becoming generic AI advice.

18
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:34,500
Gemini chooses only among conversation moves approved by deterministic policy and a finite graph.

19
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:42,415
Authored responses preserve character consistency, while a local fallback handles provider failure.

20
00:01:42,735 --> 00:01:47,635
Second Take: rehearse the moment, rewind it exactly, and compare what changed.
